Since Alien Shooter TD release the big job has been done. We have realized the major part of your wishes, corrected lots of bugs and optimized the game. 

[img]http://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/clans/27275917/233a3ca3ea4cfa98f25f2342d1a924a24b14ac83.jpg[/img]

Together with the release of version 1.2.3 we would like to offer you the game for lower price. For those who are in-game already it's a good reason to recommend the game to your friends. For those who haven't played yet it's a good reason to purchase the game, shortening your wishlist!

Below you can see the most significant changes made after release:

- new missions to complete the story;
- New monsters, including the final boss;
- a secret game mode which is extremely hardcore;
- optional auto ammo refill for soldiers;
- ability to order soldiers to hold their fire to save ammo;
- ability to auto switch to another weapon when current weapon is out of ammo;
- extra information panel for breakable objects, soldiers and monsters;
- hotkeys for frequent operations, including map scrolling with arrows and WASD keys;
- save slots and ability to start new game;
- ability to always show soldier placement slots;

